WEBVTT

00:03:57.663 --> 00:04:00.538
with my Afro, my family photos,

00:04:00.579 --> 00:04:05.496
my disability accommodation needs,
my questions, my pushback,

00:04:05.538 --> 00:04:08.413
my perspective,
grounded in the lived experience

00:04:08.454 --> 00:04:10.329
of all my identities.

00:04:11.121 --> 00:04:14.871
I show up with this full, authentic self

00:04:14.913 --> 00:04:17.746
to perform my job with excellence.

00:04:19.371 --> 00:04:22.954
But when the time comes
for the stretch projects,

00:04:22.996 --> 00:04:26.496
the promotion, equal pay, recognition,

00:04:26.538 --> 00:04:28.163
mentors, sponsors ...

00:04:29.704 --> 00:04:30.954
I'm overlooked.